+        // The once-per-boot decline line (keyed on the WHOLE reason -- a fixed-length head collided for the 15-char kind
+        // names, "victory-pending"/"victory-no-pose", whose units-not-final and wrong-phase reasons share their first 40
+        // chars; capped at 8 per boot). _endWhy always carries the latest reason. Its own prefix, `diorama end-wait:`, so a
+        // `diorama END` grep stays the clean discriminator of an end the guest ACTED on (injected / HELD / watchdog / fault).
